NCT05986227.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age \>/= 18 years;
* Male or Female;
* Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG) Performance Status of 0 or 1;
* Histologically or cytologically confirmed locally advanced adenocarcinoma of esophagus or gastroesophageal junction (Siewert type I/II);
